    "summary.md": "# Decision Log\n\nKeep lightweight decisions retrievable.\n\n- **Target user:** Small project teams\n- **Build route:** compile\n- **Genome:** workflow\n- **Presentation:** board / pipeline\n- **Persistence:** browser-local storage\n- **Start:** `npm run dev` → http://localhost:3000\n\n## Planned verification journeys\n\n- Application loads and shows a useful empty state\n- Invalid decision input shows validation without crashing\n- User can add a complete decision and see it in decisions\n- decisions survive a page refresh\n- User can edit an existing decision\n- User can search decisions\n- User can narrow decisions with a meaningful filter\n- decisions are grouped by a meaningful category or status\n- Requested derived values update from persisted records\n- User can delete an existing decision\n"
  },
